{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>這款 Geometry Calculator 是一款功能強大的幾何運算工具，專為學生、專業人士及 DIY 愛好者設計。它能快速處理三角形、圓形、球體等多種形狀的角度、邊長、面積與體積計算。目前 App Store 提供限時免費下載，原價 US $0.99，讓你輕鬆應對日常幾何難題。</p>\n\n<h2>直觀動態圖示計算</h2>\n<p>應用內建簡潔直观的界面，輸入參數後即時重算並透過互動動畫展示圖形變化。支援角度、長度、面積與體積單位切換，可自訂小數位數以滿足精確需求。涵蓋矩形、圓柱、錐體等常見幾何模型，讓複雜計算變得簡單高效，適合各類學習與工作場景使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-6-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-7-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-8-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-9-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-10-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Geometry Calculator – Triangle</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T13:59:49.353337+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}